# Title: Whoami.EXE Execution Anomaly
# ID: 8de1cbe8-d6f5-496d-8237-5f44a721c7a0
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2021-08-12
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1033, car.2016-03-001
# Description: Detects the execution of whoami.exe with suspicious parent processes.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*\\whoami.exe") OR (process_name="whoami.exe")) AND NOT ((((parent_process_path="*\\cmd.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\powershell_ise.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\powershell.exe" OR parent_process_path="*\\pwsh.exe")) OR ((parent_process_path="" OR parent_process_path="-")) OR (NOT parent_process_path=*))) AND NOT ((parent_process_path="*:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Monitoring Agent\\Agent\\MonitoringHost.exe")))
